<title>SINGAPORE: L.C. Development completes property deal.</title>
<headline>L.C. Development completes property deal.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>L.C. Development Ltd said on Monday it had completed its purchase of a Singapore office and shopping complex through a 50:50 joint venture with state gaming firm Singapore Pools (Pte) Ltd.</p>
<p>It said in a statement the purchase of Paradiz Centre had been financed by loans from its shareholders as well as a Singapore $75 million financing package arranged by the Development Bank of Singapore Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65-8703080)</p>
</text>
